  <tempo></tempo>
  <time_sig></time_sig>
  <lyrics>[V1] (L)
 有一件礼物 你收到没有
 There is a gift, have you received yet?
 眼睛看不到 你心会知道
 You cannot see it, your but your heart knows.
 这一件礼物 心门外等候
 The gift is waiting for you outside of your heart,
 是为了你准备 别人不能收
 it is prepared for you, others cannot receive it for you.

[V2] (L)
 生命有限 时光也会走
 Life is short, time will pass, if you don't grasp it,
 如果你不珍惜 机会难留
 the opportunity will go away.
 礼物虽然好 如果你不要
 Although the gift is good, if you don't accept it,
 你怎么能够得到? 怎么能得到?
 how can you get it? How can you get it?

[V3] (L)
 亲爱的朋友 你是否想到
 Dear friend, if have you ever thought...
 马槽的婴孩是为你而来
 that the baby in the manger came for you.
 亲爱的朋友 你是否了解
 Dear friend, do you understand that
 最好的礼物是人子主耶稣
 the best gift is the Son of Man, the Lord Jesus.

[V4] (L)
 生命有限 时光也会走
 Life is short, time will pass, if you don't grasp it,
 如果你不珍惜 机会难留
 the opportunity will go away.
 礼物虽然好 如果你不要
 Although the gift is good, if you don't accept it,
 你怎么能够得到? 怎么能得到?
 how can you get it? How can you get it?
</lyrics>
  <backgrounds resize="screen" keep_aspect="true" link="false" background_as_text="false"/>
</song>
